      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『英里冠军赛』是\n汇聚了速度好手的英里赛事的最高峰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbb1ae3d510e57892d52fd906da8924635ad2489b59e62f231b1cb1c05af9cce",
